  "description": "The beautiful paradise, Edenhurst. Anastasia is the only existence forbidden in that place.\n\nHaving accepted her unalterable future, she was merely waiting for the end of her life when a man appears before her.\n\nHe destroys the god she has always believed in and shakes paradise to its core...\n\nA woman tamed like a mere possession, and a man who seeks to take everything away.\n\nWhere will this relationship, born from ruin, ultimately end?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5289000099)",
